supp+=h('Recover the complete numerical/source package')+p('The WordPress connector rejected the ZIP file upload. The exact ZIP bytes are therefore preserved in a Base64 code block below; this is an explicit text transport format, not a mislabeled file. The unencoded archive contains '+str(meta['data_source']['members'])+' files and is '+str(len(archive))+' bytes. Rendered PNG/GIF files are linked separately; their original drawing code and public-media checks are in the archive. The local complete ZIP also contains the media files.')
